    "body": "I've the following in my $PROFILE:\r\n\r\n```\r\nif ($null -eq $env:SHLVL) {\r\n    [int]$env:SHLVL = 0\r\n} else {\r\n    $env:SHLVL = [int]$env:SHLVL + 1\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nWhich will fix it for me.\r\nI'd guess if you set/increment the env var in init that would fix it.\r\n\r\nBut i'm new around here and don't know anything :)",
